		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>One-eyed solder-shaped gear-construct. One arm is a brass and steel tower shield.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +4 (1d8) or barrier, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Barrier</strong>. Plant tower shield on ground. One ally can take cover behind shield, attacks or spells cast at ally, DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
